{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37345","headline":"过清凉王导墓下 · 唐彦谦","name":"过清凉王导墓下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江左风流廊庙人，荒坟抛与梵宫邻。\n多年羊虎犹眠石，败壁貂蝉祗贮尘。\n万古云山同白骨，一庭花木自青春。\n永思陵下犹凄切，废屋寒风吹野薪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}